        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/balothejester/{size}/2080_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-08-09T16:25:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey all,</p>\n<p>Sorry - put this in General at first, moved it to Events.</p>\n<p>Are you planning to be in northern California this November? If not, are you looking for an excuse to be in northern California this November?</p>\n<p>If so, you’re in luck: Thanks to Christopher’s awesomeness, I’m happy to announce that I will be running demos of Sentinels at Convolution 2012!</p>\n<p>Convolution is a brand-spankin’-new sci-fi and fantasy convention here in the Bay Area. I’m trying to help them have as good a first year as possible, and trying to help spread the word about Sentinels, and I figured, why not combine the two into one massive double-decker sandwich of awesome?</p>\n<p>Basic Info for Convolution: The con is from Friday November 2nd to Sunday November 4th, at the Hyatt in Burlingame, California. Full price of a badge for the whole weekend is currently $55, not sure what their pricing for day passes will be yet. Further info at their website, <a href=\"http://www.con-volution.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.con-volution.com</a>.</p>\n<p>I will demo-ing Sentinels in the gaming room on Sunday, noon to three.</p>\n<p>I’ll also be at the con the whole weekend, Friday night until whenever I leave Sunday and I’d love to meet up with forum folks and chat or play a game or two of Sentinels, my schedule permitting; I’ll have info on my badge name and where to find me.</p>\n<p>Hope to see some folks there!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:59.756Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
